    "detailed_description": "CYBERDRIFTER <br>                                                                                    ENTER CYBERSPACE IN VIRTUAL REALTY!<br> <br>Just as the global pandemic of 2020 was eradicated a new virus was unleashed into computer systems that threatened global communications worldwide.<br><br>A new task force was assembled of military &amp; tech specialists that can enter systems virtually to eradicate the virus in an assimilated world.<br><br>They are the CyberDrifters.<br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br>Main Mission - Enter Cyberspace armed with your gravity blaster &amp; data disc to eradicate an electronic virus in a virtual world!<br><br>Make use of your Cyber-cycle, tank &amp; glider when the need arises - Smooth locomotion &amp; blink/dash teleport movement available.<br><br>Arcade levels - Destroy the bots and compete across the globe for a place on the hi-score leaderboard.<br><br>Disc throwing mini-game<br><br>Original SynthWave music by Nicole Marie T<br><br>LIV Mixed Reality capture supported<br><br><br><strong>Build 0.6</strong> is now available! New Grav-gun, updated visuals, enemies &amp; gameplay! <br>(<strong>0.6 currently contains a tutorial and Arcade level 1</strong>)<br><br><strong>Build 0.5</strong> containing <strong>5 pre-update Arcade levels</strong> is available in the <strong>Beta branch</strong> which can be accessed by right clicking on Cyberdrifter in your Steam library, clicking on properties, then click Beta tab and then selecting <strong>beta build1</strong><br>---",
